        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***THE MEETING POINT FOR OPEN VIEWINGS IS AT BLOCK C BESIDE DAY TODAY GROCERY SHOP AT 10 BACHELORS' WALK***\r\n\r\n***PRIME LOCATION / VACANT POSSESSION / NO RENT CAPS / 8% YIELD/ FULLY FURNISHED/ SECURE DEVELOPMENT / WALKING DISTANCE TO LUAS / BUS SERVICE ON THE DOORSTEP / DIRECTLY ADJACENT TO TEMPLE BAR /INCLUDES CONTENTS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to introduce 346 Bachelors Walk, to the market. No rent caps. Fully furnished.  A very well maintained one bedroom second floor apartment, located in this exceptionally convenient development, sits in the heart of vibrant Dublin City! \r\n\r\n346 Bachelors Walk is an exciting opportunity for first time buyers looking for an excellent central location, or someone looking for a lucrative investment property. The thoughtfully laid out accommodation comprises; Entrance hall with storage press, modern family bathroom, double bedroom, fully fitted kitchen, and open living/dining room. \r\n\r\nBachelors’ Walk is a tranquil securely gated development, with beautifully maintained communal gardens where you could almost forget that you are right in the centre of the hustle and bustle of lively Dublin city centre. \r\n\r\nThis well-established development sits in an excellent location, a stone’s throw from the River Liffey and the famous Ha’Penny Bridge. Superbly situated, you have everything you need literally on the doorstep, with a fantastic array of local amenities including bars, restaurants and shops. \r\n\r\nThe IFSC, Four Courts, O' Connell Street, Grafton Street, Temple Bar and Jervis Street Shopping Centre are just a short stroll away. With ample bus services, The Luas and The DART in close proximity, you could not want for a better location."
      },
